// Required Lab 4: complete the unless block, then add this policy with the
// AgentCore CLI. The target-qualified action is generated by Gateway.
//
// Goal: the authenticated principal may only file a return for itself. AgentCore
// Policy exposes JWT claims as principal tags, so the Cognito access token's
// `username` claim is comparable against the tool input. The rule is fail-closed:
// a missing claim, missing customer_id, or mismatched identity is denied before
// the tool executes.
forbid(
  principal,
  action == AgentCore::Action::"pellier-concierge-experience-target___initiate_return",
  resource is AgentCore::Gateway
)
unless {
  false
};
